
ml:.* ALLOW
CERT:CREATE:__ML_ISSUER__(?::.*)? ALLOW CERT_CREATE
CERT:STATUS:__ML_ISSUER__(?::.*)? ALLOW CERT_STATUS
# The two certificate listing views that are open to everyone, named by issuer so this
# gateway claims only what its own certificate manager can answer. The plain names are
# deliberately absent: both certificate managers answer those and neither gateway could
# say which department a request meant. The view of certificates awaiting a decision is
# deliberately absent too - a gateway makes its upstream connection as itself, so the
# certificate manager's read gate would see the gateway rather than the administrator.
CERT:LIST:__ML_ISSUER__:ALL ALLOW CERT_STATUS
CERT:LIST:__ML_ISSUER__:EXPIRING ALLOW CERT_STATUS
